{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06352","headline":"登首阳山谒夷齐庙 · 李颀","name":"登首阳山谒夷齐庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人已不见，乔木竟谁过。\n寂寞首阳山，白云空复多。\n苍苔归地骨，皓首采薇歌。\n毕命无怨色，成仁其若何。\n我来入遗庙，时候微清和。\n落日吊山鬼，回风吹女萝。\n石崖向西豁，引领望黄河。\n千里一飞鸟，孤光东逝波。\n驱车层城路，惆怅此岩阿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}